OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash was 'caring
OL,4,Aand loving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died in a
OL,7,Fmotorbike crash have paid tribute to
OL,8,Fhim, describing him as a "caring and
OL,9,Floving" father and grandfather.
OL,11,FDavid Doyle, 53, from
OL,12,FWeston-super-Mare, died after the
OL,13,Fsingle-vehicle collision as he rode his
OL,14,Fmotorcycle on the A370 near Bleadon on
OL,15,F4 October.
OL,17,FHis fiancee Danielle, his son Jordan,
OL,18,Fdaughter Paige and his nephew Leon said
OL,19,Fin a tribute that he was one of the
OL,20,F"most selfless, caring and loving
OL,21,Fpeople you could ever meet".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
