OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash was 'caring
OL,4,Aand loving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tribute said: "Our lives have been
OL,7,Fturned upside down. Just as life
OL,8,Fstarted to look up for him and all his
OL,9,Fdreams were coming to fruition, his
OL,10,Flife has been cut far too short."
